# CivicFund Radar — Environment Configuration Example
# Note: CivicFund Radar requires NO commercial API keys (No OpenAI, No Anthropic, No Stripe, No Exa).
# All core CLI discovery and retrieval commands run on free, public federal data.

# (Optional) Custom local data directory for the SQLite ledger
# Default on Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\civicfund-radar
# Default on Linux/macOS: $XDG_DATA_HOME/civicfund-radar or ~/.local/share/civicfund-radar
# XDG_DATA_HOME=/path/to/custom/local/share

# (Optional) Environment overrides for OpenProse upstream agent runner
# CIVICFUND_RADAR_BIN=./cli/civicfund-radar/civicfund-radar.exe
# CIVICFUND_RADAR_DB=./fixtures/test-demo.sqlite

# (Planned Extensions — Not currently active in core CLI)
# TINYFISH_API_KEY=your_planned_tinyfish_key_here
# TINYFISH_SEARCH_ENDPOINT=https://api.tinyfish.ai/v1/search
# TINYFISH_FETCH_ENDPOINT=https://api.tinyfish.ai/v1/fetch
